# AI Agentic data
# CLAUDE.md is shared: it carries the project knowledge base. Everything else
# under .claude/ stays local — settings.local.json is per-machine, and
# skills/ is a generated copy of the tracked skills/ directory written by
# `dtmgd skills install`.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/CLAUDE.md
/.ai-containers

# Snapshot data
snapshot.json
/.agent-discovery/
